msgstr "``--console-key-file <path>``"

#: ../../operations.rst:177
msgid ""
"64 hex characters, owner-only permissions; protects stored second-factor "
"and webhook secrets"
msgstr "64 个十六进制字符，仅所有者可访问；保护存储的第二因素密钥和 webhook 密钥"

#: ../../operations.rst:178
