"Store redacted request and origin response heads per incident; off by "
"default"
msgstr "为每个事件存储脱敏后的请求头部和源站响应头部；默认关闭"

#: ../../operations.rst:200
msgid "``--console-capture-header <name>``"
msgstr "``--console-capture-header <name>``"

#: ../../operations.rst:201
